---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base path="/about" title="About" description="Noorani Canteen has been cooking biryani since 1987. NC Taj is how it reaches you now.">
  <section class="section page-head">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Since {site.established}</p>
      <h1>Noorani Canteen.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        NC Taj is short for Noorani Canteen — the name above the door since 1987.
      </p>

      <div class="card" style="margin-block: 3rem;">
        <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;">
          <span class="photo__mark" aria-hidden="true">1987</span>
          <span class="photo__note">Photo pending</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        We started as a canteen, and in most of the ways that matter we still are
        one. The same biryani, cooked the same way — bone-in, layered, sealed and
        left on dum until it's ready rather than until someone's in a hurry.
      </p>
      <p>
        What changed is how it reaches you. There's no dining room now. Everything
        goes out the door to Swiggy, Zomato and Magicpin, which means the kitchen
        does one thing and does it properly.
      </p>
      <p>
        The menu is deliberately short. Biryani is what we're known for. The
        gravies, the desserts and the chai earned their place over the years and
        haven't moved since.
      </p>

      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/order" data-track="order_click" data-placement="about">Order Now</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
